Package: pdrReproduce
Type: Package
Title: Reproduction of Proximal Dose-Response Simulation Experiments
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Reproducibility project
Maintainer: Repository maintenance <package@example.org>
Description: Executes frozen simulation engines for dose-response and
    derivative inference and fold-averaged parametric-null tests. Provides
    deterministic task plans, original-seed recovery mappings, checkpointed
    execution, result validation, and streaming summaries.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: parallel, tools, utils, stats, Rcpp, Matrix, rlang
Suggests: ggplot2
SystemRequirements: C++17; BLAS and Fortran runtime matching R
